  "description": "Fast, dependency-free PDF generation: text in many scripts with TrueType and OpenType fonts embedded as subsets, tables, charts, barcodes, SVG and Markdown, PDF/UA and PDF/A, merging and AES-256. The same API in Java, Go and Swift. Fonts included, so the output is the same on servers and in Docker, with no system fonts needed: every European language (Latin, Greek, Cyrillic) in this package; for other scripts (Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Hebrew, Thai), also add the package PDFjet.Fonts.World, the same version.",
